[59.898507, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[1mSection in design/index.html:\u001b[22m \u001b[1mEvents\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWha\u001b[7G you \u001b[13Geed:\u001b[22m Records with a\u001b[33Gdate, a\u001b[41Gtime\u001b[46Gand\u001b[50Ga\u001b[52Gplace,\u001b[59Gshown\u001b[65Gas\u001b[68Gan\u001b[71Gupcoming\u001b[80Glist.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mRecommendation:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249meventnews\u001b[39m, which adds\u001b[41Gevents to the n\u001b[57Gws extension,\u001b[71Gonly supports up\u001b[88Gto\u001b[91GTYPO3\u001b[97G12.\u001b[101GSo\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  either build a small event recor\u001b[38G in the \u001b[47Gi\u001b[49Gepackag\u001b[57G (I'd do this, there are only a few fields), \u001b[103Gr\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Buse news record\u001b[21G in an \"Events\" category\u001b[46Gand \u001b[51Gut th\u001b[58Gtime\u001b[63Gand place in the teaser.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSection in design/index.html:\u001b[22m \u001b[1mNewsletter sign-up\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWha\u001b[7G you \u001b[13Geed:\u001b[22m Storing subscribers with topics and\u001b[54Gconsent,\u001b[63Ga\u001b[65Gdouble\u001b[72Gopt-in\u001b[79Gemail,\u001b[86Gan\u001b[89Gunsubscribe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  link, and some\u001b[20Ghing that sends the newsletter. The core form extension can show the\u001b[89Gform, but it\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdoesn't \u001b[14Go double op\u001b[26G-in\u001b[30Gor manag\u001b[40Gsub\u001b[44Gcrib\u001b[50Gs.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mRecommendation:\u001b[22m This depe\u001b[29Gds on your\u001b[40Ganswe\u001b[46G to the\u001b[54Gquestion\u001b[63Gbelow.\u001b[70GEither\u001b[77Gway,\u001b[82Gcopy\u001b[87G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdesign/js/forms.js\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  over for the val\u001b[22Gdation in\u001b[32Gthe browser.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe one decision only you can make: who sends the 