[60.54619, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G  use news records in an \"Events\" category and put th\u001b[57G time a\u001b[65Gd place in\u001b[76Gthe tea\u001b[84Ger.\u001b[88G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSection in design/index.html:\u001b[22m \u001b[1mNewsletter sign-up\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat you need:\u001b[22m Storing subscribers with topics\u001b[50Gand\u001b[54Gconsent,\u001b[63Ga\u001b[65Gdouble\u001b[72Gopt-in\u001b[79Gemail,\u001b[86Gan\u001b[89Gunsubscribe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  link, and something that sends the newsletter.\u001b[52GThe\u001b[56Gcore\u001b[61Gform\u001b[66Gextension\u001b[76Gcan\u001b[80Gshow\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gform,\u001b[95Gbut\u001b[99Git\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  doesn't do double opt-in o\u001b[32G manage subscr\u001b[47Gbers.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mRecommendation:\u001b[22m T\u001b[22Gs depend\u001b[31G on your\u001b[40Ganswer \u001b[48Go the question below. Either way, copy \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdesign/js/forms.js\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mov\u001b[8Gr for the va\u001b[21Gidation in the brow\u001b[41Ger.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe one decision only you can make: who sends the newsletter?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mAn external service\u001b[25G\u001b[22m(Brevo,\u001b[33GMailchimp,\u001b[44GCleverReach…):\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gsite\u001b[68Gonly\u001b[73Gcollects\u001b[82Gthe\u001b[86Gsign-up\u001b[94Gand\u001b[98Gpasses\u001b[105Git\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  on, and the service handles double opt-in, sending and unsubscribing.\u001b[75GThis\u001b[80Gis\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87Gleast\u001b[93Gwork\u001b[98Gin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GTYPO3.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mTYPO3 itself\u001b[22m: you need an extension such as \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcodingms/newsletters\u001b[39m (topics plu\u001b[83Gdoub\u001b[89G opt-in;\u001b[98Gthe\r\u001b[4C\