[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- typos (\"the the old market keep\u001b[39Gt\u001b[41Gere stall number\", \"Pedestrains\", \"helth\", \"volunter\",\u001b[96G\"Contcat\")\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bone date s\u001b[18Gt in\u001b[23G\u001b[1m2062\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bat le\u001b[13Gst\u001b[16Gone\u001b[20Ge\u001b[22Gtry with\u001b[31Gno\u001b[34Gteaser\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BAfter\u001b[11Gthat,\u001b[17Geverything\u001b[28Ggoes\u001b[33Ginto\u001b[38G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInitialisation/data.xml\u001b[62G\u001b[39mas\u001b[65Gdescribed\u001b[75Gin\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gpackage\u001b[90GREADME.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRe-exporting the distribution.\u001b[22m Once there are news and event re\u001b[69Gords,\u001b[75Gthe export ne\u001b[89Gds their\u001b[98Gtables\u001b[105Gas\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gwell (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--table=tx_news_domain_model_news\u001b[39m \u001b[46Gtc.), and\u001b[56Gthe\u001b[60Gslider image\u001b[73G go into \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml.files/\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI'd\u001b[7Ggo\u001b[10Gin\u001b[13Gthis\u001b[18Gorder:\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Gslider\u001b[36Gand\u001b[40Gthe\u001b[44Gtiles\u001b[50Gfirst\u001b[56G(they're\u001b[65Gsitepackage-only),\u001b[84Gthen\u001b[89Gnews,\u001b[95Gthen\u001b[100Gevents,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthen the newsletter once you'v\u001b[34G picked how it's sen\u001b[55G. S\u001b[59Gould I s\u001b[68Gart with the slider?\u001b[89G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GSautéed for 42s · done 9:29 AM\u001b[40G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[243.292352, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G- \u001b[1mAn external service\u001b[22m (Brevo, Mailchimp, CleverReach…): the\u001b[63Gsite only collects\u001b[82Gthe sign-up and passes it\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bn, and the serv\u001b[22Gce ha\u001b[28Gdles dou\u001b[37Gle opt-in,\u001b[48Gsending\u001b[56Gand\u001b[60Gunsubscribing.\u001b[75GThis\u001b[80Gis\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87Gleast\u001b[93Gwork\u001b[98Gin\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BTYPO3.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mTYPO3\u001b[11Gitself\u001b[22m: you need an extension such as \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcodingms/newsletters\u001b[70G\u001b[39m(topics\u001b[78Gplus\u001b[83Gdouble\u001b[90Gopt-in;\u001b[98Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GCleverReach sync is\u001b[25Gin the paid Pro version) or \u001b[38;2;177;185;249msgalinski/sg-campaigns\u001b[39m. I haven't checked either one\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfor\u001b[9GTYPO3 14.3 support yet.\u001b[33GI'd do\u001b[40Gthat before picki\u001b[58Gg\u001b[60Go\u001b[62Ge.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mAlso needed for all of it:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mInitial content.\u001b[22G\u001b[22mThe texts\u001b[32Gfor the slider and the tiles are in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mindex.html\u001b[39m. Th\u001b[83G news and ev\u001b[96Gn\u001b[98Gs are in\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdesign/docs/news-and-events.docx\u001b[39m. That document has err\u001b[61Grs to\u001b[67Gfix\u001b[71Gbefore\u001b[78Gimporting\u001b[88Git:\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7Gtypos\u001b[13G(\"the\u001b[19Gthe\u001b[23Gold\u001b[27Gmarket\u001b[34Gkeep\u001b[39Gthere\u001b[45Gstall\u001b[51Gnumber\",\u001b[60G\"Pedestrains\",\u001b[75G\"helth\",\u001b[84G\"volunter\",\u001b[96G\"Contcat\")\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  - one date set in \u001b[1m2062\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- at least one entry\u001b[26Gwith no teas\u001b[39Gr\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BAf\u001b[8Ger that, \u001b[18Gverything goes into \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInitialisation/data.xml\u001b[39m as described\u001b[75Gin the package README.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRe-exporting the distribution.\u001b[36G\u001b[22mOnce\u001b[41Gthere\u001b[47Gare\u001b[51Gnews\u001b[56Gand\u001b[60Gevent\u001b[66Grecords,\u001b[75Gthe\u001b[79Gexport\u001b[86Gneeds\u001b[92Gtheir\u001b[98Gtables\u001b[105Gas\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bwell\u001b[10G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--table=tx_news_domain_model_news\u001b[45G\u001b[39metc.),\u001b[52Gand\u001b[56Gthe\u001b[60Gslider\u001b[67Gimages\u001b[74Ggo\u001b[77Ginto\u001b[82G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml.files/\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BI'd go in this order: the slider and the tiles first (they're\u001b[65Gsitepackage-only), then news, then\u001b[100Gevents,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthen the newsletter once you've pick\u001b[40Gd \u001b[43Gow it's\u001b[51Gs\u001b[53Gnt. Should I\u001b[66Gstart with th\u001b[80G slider?\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GSautéed for 42s · done 9:29 AM\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mYou want the empty home page to show the design's slider, service tiles, news, events and \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnewsletter sign-up, and I've worked out what each one needs. Next, I'd build the slider content element,\r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3monce you say go and decide who sends the newsletter. (turn off recaps in /config)\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
