keeps\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bupdated, and it's the\u001b[28Gpart of the home page\u001b[50Gthat\u001b[55Gchanges\u001b[63Gevery\u001b[69Gweek.\u001b[75GThe\u001b[79Gslider\u001b[86Gand\u001b[90Gtiles\u001b[96Gare\u001b[100Ga\u001b[102Gfew\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gfixed entries that rarely change.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mIt starts the content cleanup early.\u001b[22m The document \u001b[58Gs typos, a\u001b[69Gdate set in 2062\u001b[90Ga mi\u001b[95Gsing\u001b[100Gteaser.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BSom\u001b[10Gon\u001b[13G at the municipa\u001b[30Gity has to\u001b[41Gfix\u001b[45Gthose.\u001b[52GIf\u001b[55Gnews\u001b[60Ggoes\u001b[65Gfirst,\u001b[72Gthat\u001b[77Greview\u001b[84Gcan\u001b[88Ghappen\u001b[95Gwhile\u001b[101Gyou\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gbuild the other sections.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mIt settles events cheaply.\u001b[22m Once\u001b[38Gnews is running,\u001b[55Gyou can \u001b[64Gee whether news r\u001b[82Gcords\u001b[88Gin an \"Events\"\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bcategory are good enough before\u001b[38Gyou\u001b[42Gbuild\u001b[48Ga\u001b[50Gseparate\u001b[59Gevent\u001b[65Grecord.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B5\u001b[6G\u001b[1mO\u001b[8Gher parts li\u001b[21Gk to it.\u001b[22m The home page'\u001b[46G\"All \u001b[52Gews\" link and the \"S\u001b[73Ge\u001b[75Gthe forum \u001b[86Gates\" slide \u001b[99Geed\u001b[103Gnews\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bp\u001b[8Gg\u001b[10Gs to\u001b[15Gpoint to.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
