[257.178088, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mYou want the empty home page to show the design's slider, service tiles, news, events and \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3mnewsletter\u001b[14Gsign-up,\u001b[23Gand I've worked\u001b[39Gout what each one needs. Next, I'd build the slider content element,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bonce you say \u001b[17Go and\u001b[23Gdecide who sen\u001b[38Gs the newsletter. (turn off recaps in /config)\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mThat sounds like a lot. What should I start with, and why?\u001b[39m                                              \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'd\u001b[7Gstart\u001b[13Gwith\u001b[18G\u001b[1mNews\u001b[22m.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhy news first:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mIt's mostly installing, not building.\u001b[44G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgeorgringer/news\u001b[61G\u001b[39malready\u001b[69Gsupports\u001b[78GTYPO3\u001b[84G14.3,\u001b[90Gso\u001b[93Gthere's\u001b[101Gno\u001b[104GTCA\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gor JavaScript to write. You install it, add a News page and a detail page, and write template\u001b[101Gthat\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Butput the design's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.card\u001b[39m markup. The sli\u001b[48Ger and tiles e\u001b[63Gch\u001b[66Gneed \u001b[72G new conte\u001b[83Gt\u001b[85Gelem\u001b[90Gn\u001b[92G with its own\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bfields\u001b[13Gand\u001b[17Gt\u001b[19Gmplates, which is more code.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mIt's the most real content.\u001b[34G\u001b[22mThe news and events\u001b[54Gdocument\u001b[63Gis\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gmain\u001b[75Gthing\u001b[81Gthe\u001b[85Gmunicipality\u001b[98Gkeeps\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gupdated, and it's the part of the home page that changes\u001b[63Gevery week.\u001b[75GT\u001b[77Ge slid\u001b[84Gr a\u001b[88Gd tiles are a few\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bfixed entries \u001b[21Ghat rarely change.\u001b[40G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mIt starts the content cleanup early.\u001b[43G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[47Gdocument\u001b[56Ghas\u001b[60Gtypos,\u001b[67Ga\u001b[69Gdate\u001b[74Gset\u001b[78Gin\u001b[81G2062\u001b[86Gand\u001b[90Ga\u001b[92Gmissing\u001b[100Gteaser.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6GSomeone at the municipality has to fix those. If new\u001b[60Ggoes first, that review can happen while you\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bbuild the o\u001b[20Gr sect\u001b[27Gons.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mIt settles events cheaply.\u001b[33G\u001b[22mOnce\u001b[38Gnews\u001b[43Gis\u001b[46Grunning,\u001b[55Gyou\u001b[59Gcan\u001b[63Gsee\u001b[67Gwhether\u001b[75Gnews\u001b[80Grecords\u001b[88Gin\u001b[91Gan\u001b[94G\"Events\"\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gcategory are good enough befor\u001b[38Gyou build a separate\u001b[59Gevent record.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B5.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mOther parts link to it.\u001b[22m Th\u001b[33G home page's \"All news\" link and the \"See\u001b[75Gthe\u001b[79Gforum\u001b[85Gdates\"\u001b[92Gslide\u001b[98Gneed\u001b[103Gnews\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gpages to point to.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mIt's less work than the table made it look.\u001b[47G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[51Gfive\u001b[56Gsections\u001b[65Gdon't\u001b[71Gdepend\u001b[78Gon\u001b[81Geach\u001b[86Gother,\u001b[93Gand\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Ghome\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
