[258.727442, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[1mWhy news first:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mIt's mostly installing, not building.\u001b[44G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgeorgringer/news\u001b[61G\u001b[39malready\u001b[69Gsupports\u001b[78GTYPO3\u001b[84G14.3,\u001b[90Gso\u001b[93Gthere's\u001b[101Gno\u001b[104GTCA\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gor JavaScript to write. You install it, add a News page and a detail page, and write template\u001b[101Gthat\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Butput the design's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.card\u001b[39m markup. The sli\u001b[48Ger and tiles e\u001b[63Gch\u001b[66Gneed \u001b[72G new conte\u001b[83Gt\u001b[85Gelem\u001b[90Gn\u001b[92G with its own\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bfields\u001b[13Gand\u001b[17Gt\u001b[19Gmplates, which is more code.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mIt's the most real content.\u001b[34G\u001b[22mThe news and events\u001b[54Gdocument\u001b[63Gis\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gmain\u001b[75Gthing\u001b[81Gthe\u001b[85Gmunicipality\u001b[98Gkeeps\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gupdated, and it's the part of the home page that changes\u001b[63Gevery week.\u001b[75GT\u001b[77Ge slid\u001b[84Gr a\u001b[88Gd tiles are a few\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bfixed entries \u001b[21Ghat rarely change.\u001b[40G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mIt starts the content cleanup early.\u001b[43G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[47Gdocument\u001b[56Ghas\u001b[60Gtypos,\u001b[67Ga\u001b[69Gdate\u001b[74Gset\u001b[78Gin\u001b[81G2062\u001b[86Gand\u001b[90Ga\u001b[92Gmissing\u001b[100Gteaser.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6GSomeone at the municipality has to fix those. If new\u001b[60Ggoes first, that review can happen while you\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bbuild the o\u001b[20Gr sect\u001b[27Gons.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mIt settles events cheaply.\u001b[33G\u001b[22mOnce\u001b[38Gnews\u001b[43Gis\u001b[46Grunning,\u001b[55Gyou\u001b[59Gcan\u001b[63Gsee\u001b[67Gwhether\u001b[75Gnews\u001b[80Grecords\u001b[88Gin\u001b[91Gan\u001b[94G\"Events\"\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gcategory are good enough befor\u001b[38Gyou build a separate\u001b[59Gevent record.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B5.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mOther parts link to it.\u001b[22m Th\u001b[33G home page's \"All news\" link and the \"See\u001b[75Gthe\u001b[79Gforum\u001b[85Gdates\"\u001b[92Gslide\u001b[98Gneed\u001b[103Gnews\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gpages to point to.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mIt's less work than the table made it look.\u001b[47G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[51Gfive\u001b[56Gsections\u001b[65Gdon't\u001b[71Gdepend\u001b[78Gon\u001b[81Geach\u001b[86Gother,\u001b[93Gand\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Ghome\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpage fills in one section at a time. Each step is finished and visibl\u001b[73G o\u001b[76G its\u001b[81Gown.\u001b[86GThe newslet\u001b[98Ger\u001b[101Gis the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bonly\u001b[8Gpart waiti\u001b[19Gg\u001b[21Gon your\u001b[29Gdecision about who sends \u001b[55Gt, an\u001b[62Gnothing e\u001b[72Gse depends on\u001b[86Git,\u001b[90Gso it can go\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Blast.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSuggested order:\u001b[20G\u001b[22mnews\u001b[25G→\u001b[27Gtiles\u001b[33G(small,\u001b[41Gquick)\u001b[48G→\u001b[50Gslider\u001b[57G→\u001b[59Gevents\u001b[66G(once\u001b[72Gyou've\u001b[79Gseen\u001b[84Ghow\u001b[88Gnews\u001b[93Ghandles\u001b[101Gthem)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B→ newsletter.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BShould\u001b[10GI\u001b[12Gset\u001b[16Gup\u001b[19Gnews\u001b[24Gnow?\u001b[29GI'd\u001b[33Gadd\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41Gextension\u001b[51Gwith\u001b[56Gcomposer,\u001b[66Gcreate\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77GNews\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Gdetail\u001b[93Gpages\u001b[99Gin\u001b[102Gthe\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
