ts\"\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gcategory are good enough befor\u001b[38Gyou build a separate\u001b[59Gevent record.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B5.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mOther parts link to it.\u001b[22m Th\u001b[33G home page's \"All news\" link and the \"See\u001b[75Gthe\u001b[79Gforum\u001b[85Gdates\"\u001b[92Gslide\u001b[98Gneed\u001b[103Gnews\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gpages to point to.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mIt's less work than the table made it look.\u001b[47G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[51Gfive\u001b[56Gsections\u001b[65Gdon't\u001b[71Gdepend\u001b[78Gon\u001b[81Geach\u001b[86Gother,\u001b[93Gand\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Ghome\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpage fills in one section at a time. Each step is finished and visibl\u001b[73G o\u001b[76G its\u001b[81Gown.\u001b[86GThe newslet\u001b[98Ger\u001b[101Gis the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bonly\u001b[8Gpart waiti\u001b[19Gg\u001b[21Gon your\u001b[29Gdecision about who sends \u001b[55Gt, an\u001b[62Gnothing e\u001b[72Gse depends on\u001b[86Git,\u001b[90Gso it can go\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Blast.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSuggested order:\u001b[20G\u001b[22mnews\u001b[25G→\u001b[27Gtiles\u001b[33G(small,\u001b[41Gquick)\u001b[48G→\u001b[50Gslider\u001b[57G→\u001b[59Gevents\u001b[66G(once\u001b[72Gyou've\u001b[79Gseen\u001b[84Ghow\u001b[88Gnews\u001b[93Ghandles\u001b[101Gthem)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B→ newsletter.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BShould\u001b[10GI\u001b[12Gset\u001b[16Gup\u001b[19Gnews\u001b[24Gnow?\u001b[29GI'd\u001b[33Gadd\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41Gextension\u001b[51Gwith\u001b[56Gcomposer,\u001b[66Gcreate\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77GNews\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Gdetail\u001b[93Gpages\u001b[99Gin\u001b[102Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bseed script,\u001b[16Gand override\u001b[29Gthe\u001b[33Glist t\u001b[69Gcards.\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
