needs:\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B- access to the News folder\u001b[34Gand\u001b[38Gthe co\u001b[45Gt\u001b[47Gnt pages\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Bpermi\u001b[14Gsi\u001b[17Gn to\u001b[22Gedit\u001b[27Gthe news and category tabl\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Ba file m\u001b[17Gun\u001b[20G for news images, so th\u001b[44Gy can't upload\u001b[59Ganywhere\u001b[68Gelse\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mReadable URLs.\u001b[21G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[25Gsite\u001b[30Ghas no route configuration yet, so a n\u001b[69Gw\u001b[71G detail\u001b[79Gpage\u001b[84Gwould\u001b[90Gget\u001b[94Ga\u001b[96Glink\u001b[101Glike\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m?tx_news_pi1[news]=12\u001b[39m. A route\u001b[37Genhancer turns \u001b[53Ghat\u001b[57Gin\u001b[60Go\u001b[62G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/news/new-fish-market-opens-at-the-jetty\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mA restricted text editor (RTE).\u001b[22m T\u001b[40Ge body text\u001b[52Gedi\u001b[56Gor should only offer the formatting the design\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gsupports, so editors can't paste in\u001b[42Gstyling \u001b[51Ghat breaks the\u001b[66Glook.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat editors can't change, and shouldn't:\u001b[45G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[49Gcard\u001b[54Glayout,\u001b[62Gthe\u001b[66Gnumber\u001b[73Gof\u001b[76Gnews\u001b[81Gon\u001b[84Gthe\u001b[88Ghome\u001b[93Gpage\u001b[98Gand\u001b[102Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpage structure. Those stay in the sit\u001b[69G\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
