[950.970139, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5Ghidden from\u001b[18Ghe menu (the E-\u001b[34Gervices portal, for\u001b[54Gexample), because\u001b[72Gthe\u001b[76Gbreadcrumb\u001b[87Gskipped\u001b[95Gpages\u001b[101Ghidden\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gfrom the navigation. That's\u001b[33Gfixed. On article pages\u001b[57Gi\u001b[60Gcurrently ends in \"Article\" rather than the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bnews title.\u001b[17G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat editors get\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m-\u001b[5GA\u001b[7G\"News\u001b[13Grecords\"\u001b[22Gfolder\u001b[29Gholding\u001b[37G8\u001b[39Gcategories\u001b[50Gand\u001b[54G7\u001b[56Gnews\u001b[61Gitems\u001b[67Gtaken\u001b[73Gfrom\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gdocument.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- A backend group\u001b[21Gcalled\u001b[28G\"Editors\",\u001b[39Gcreated\u001b[47Gautomatically\u001b[61Gwhen\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gpackage\u001b[78Gis\u001b[81Gset\u001b[85Gup.\u001b[89GI\u001b[91Gchecked\u001b[99Gwith\u001b[104Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtemporary test user (delete\u001b[33G afterw\u001b[41Grds). They can:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G-\u001b[7Gedit pages, content,\u001b[28Gnews and categories on every page;\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- use the\u001b[15GPage, List and M\u001b[33Gi\u001b[35G modules;\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bupload images, which\u001b[28Ggo to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfileadmin/user_upload/news/\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BTh\u001b[10Gy can't use the\u001b[26Graw\u001b[30GHTML content element.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GPages created later belong to Editors automatically.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA\u001b[7Gtext\u001b[12Geditor limit\u001b[25Gd to\u001b[30Gparagraphs, two h\u001b[48Gading\u001b[54Glevels,\u001b[62Gbold,\u001b[68Gitalic,\u001b[76Glists\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Glinks.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BYou only ne\u001b[19Gto c\u001b[24Geate the editor acco\u001b[45Gnts (System >\u001b[59GBackend\u001b[67Gusers)\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Gput\u001b[82Gthem\u001b[87Gin\u001b[90G\"Editors\".\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mContent I changed on my own\u001b[22m (the C\u001b[38Gmmunications Office should check this)\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GI\u001b[7Gfixed\u001b[13Gthe\u001b[17Gtypos\u001b[23Gfrom\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32Gdocument:\u001b[42G\"the\u001b[47Gthe\",\u001b[53G\"there\u001b[60Gstall\",\u001b[68G\"Pedestrains\",\u001b[83G\"helth\",\u001b[92G\"volunter\".\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- I read the boreholes date\u001b[31G\"2062\" as 2026.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bleft out \"Youth\u001b[23Gbursari\u001b[31Gs: applications\u001b[47Gop\u001b[50Gn\"\u001b[53Gbecause it breaks off mid-\u001b[80Gentence.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSomething to know on this installation:\u001b[22m my first \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mextension:setup\u001b[39m run created a s\u001b[84Gcond\u001b[89Gcopy\u001b[94Gof\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gwhole\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpage\u001b[8Gtree.\u001b[14GThis\u001b[19Ginstallation\u001b[32Gwas\u001b[36Gfilled\u001b[43Gby\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gseed\u001b[55Gscript,\u001b[63Gso\u001b[66Git\u001b[69Ghad\u001b[73Gnever\u001b[79Grecorded\u001b[88Gthat\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gpackage's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcontent was imported. I restored the database from the snapshot I took beforehand a\u001b[89Grecorded the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bimpor\u001b[9G. Now the\u001b[19Gdata is clean: 29 pag\u001b[41Gs, one group.\u001b[55GThe README\u001b[66Gexpl\u001b[71Gins how\u001b[79Gto avoi\u001b[90Gis.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[951.469542, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5Gfrom the navigatio\u001b[24G.\u001b[26GThat's fixed. On a\u001b[46Gicle pag\u001b[55Gs it currently \u001b[71Gnds in \"Article\" rath\u001b[93Gr\u001b[95Gthan t\u001b[102Ge\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bnews\u001b[11Gitle.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat editors get\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- A \"News records\"\u001b[22Gfolder\u001b[29Gholding\u001b[37G8\u001b[39Gcategories\u001b[50Gand\u001b[54G7\u001b[56Gnews\u001b[61Gitems\u001b[67Gtaken\u001b[73Gfrom\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gdocument.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bbackend group cal\u001b[25Ged \"Editors\",\u001b[40Greated automatically\u001b[61Gwh\u001b[64Gn the package\u001b[78Gis set \u001b[86Gp. I checked\u001b[99Gwith\u001b[104Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtemporary\u001b[15Gtest user (\u001b[27Geleted afterwards).\u001b[47GThey can:\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- edit pages, content, n\u001b[30Gws and categories on every\u001b[57Gpage;\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Buse the Page, List and Media modules;\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Bpload im\u001b[19Gs, which go to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfileadmin/user_upload/news/\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BThey can't u\u001b[20Ge\u001b[22Gt\u001b[24Ge raw HTML content element.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GPages created later belong to\u001b[35GEdi\u001b[39Gors\u001b[43Gautoma\u001b[50Gically.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BA t\u001b[9Gxt edi\u001b[16Gor\u001b[20Gimited t\u001b[29G paragraphs, two he\u001b[49Gd\u001b[51Gng \u001b[55Gevels,\u001b[62Gbold,\u001b[68Gitalic,\u001b[76Glists\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Glinks.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BYou only need\u001b[19Gto cr\u001b[25Gate the editor accounts (System > Backen\u001b[66G users) and put\u001b[82Gthem \u001b[89G \"Editors\".\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mContent I changed on my own\u001b[31G\u001b[22m(the\u001b[36GCommunications\u001b[51GOffice\u001b[58Gshould\u001b[65Gcheck\u001b[71Gthis)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- I fixed the typos from the document: \"the the\", \"th\u001b[57Gre stall\", \"Pedestrains\",\u001b[83G\"helth\",\u001b[92G\"volunter\".\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bread the boreholes da\u001b[29Ge \"2062\" as 2026.\u001b[47G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bl\u001b[9Gft\u001b[12Gout\u001b[16G\"Youth burs\u001b[28Gries: applications\u001b[47Gopen\"\u001b[53Gbecause\u001b[61Git\u001b[64Gbreaks\u001b[71Goff\u001b[75Gmid-sentence.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSomething to know on this installation:\u001b[43G\u001b[22mmy\u001b[46Gfirst\u001b[52G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mextension:setup\u001b[68G\u001b[39mrun\u001b[72Gcreated\u001b[80Ga\u001b[82Gsecond\u001b[89Gcopy\u001b[94Gof\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gwhole\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpage tree. This installation was filled\u001b[43Gb\u001b[46Gthe seed script, so it had n\u001b[75Gver recorded that the\u001b[97Gpackage's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcontent was imported. I restored\u001b[36Gthe database from the snapsh\u001b[65Gt I\u001b[69Gtook beforehand and record\u001b[96Gd the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bimport.\u001b[11GNow\u001b[15Gthe data is\u001b[27Gclean: 29 pages, one group. The README explains how to avoid this.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhere things are:\u001b[21G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[25Gnews\u001b[30Gtemplates\u001b[40Gare\u001b[44Gin\u001b[47G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Extensions/News/\u001b[39m,\u001b[83Grouting\u001b[91Gin\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
