[953.022253, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G- edit pages, content, n\u001b[30Gws and categories on every\u001b[57Gpage;\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Buse the Page, List and Media modules;\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Bpload im\u001b[19Gs, which go to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfileadmin/user_upload/news/\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BThey can't u\u001b[20Ge\u001b[22Gt\u001b[24Ge raw HTML content element.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GPages created later belong to\u001b[35GEdi\u001b[39Gors\u001b[43Gautoma\u001b[50Gically.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BA t\u001b[9Gxt edi\u001b[16Gor\u001b[20Gimited t\u001b[29G paragraphs, two he\u001b[49Gd\u001b[51Gng \u001b[55Gevels,\u001b[62Gbold,\u001b[68Gitalic,\u001b[76Glists\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Glinks.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BYou only need\u001b[19Gto cr\u001b[25Gate the editor accounts (System > Backen\u001b[66G users) and put\u001b[82Gthem \u001b[89G \"Editors\".\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mContent I changed on my own\u001b[31G\u001b[22m(the\u001b[36GCommunications\u001b[51GOffice\u001b[58Gshould\u001b[65Gcheck\u001b[71Gthis)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- I fixed the typos from the document: \"the the\", \"th\u001b[57Gre stall\", \"Pedestrains\",\u001b[83G\"helth\",\u001b[92G\"volunter\".\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bread the boreholes da\u001b[29Ge \"2062\" as 2026.\u001b[47G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bl\u001b[9Gft\u001b[12Gout\u001b[16G\"Youth burs\u001b[28Gries: applications\u001b[47Gopen\"\u001b[53Gbecause\u001b[61Git\u001b[64Gbreaks\u001b[71Goff\u001b[75Gmid-sentence.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSomething to know on this installation:\u001b[43G\u001b[22mmy\u001b[46Gfirst\u001b[52G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mextension:setup\u001b[68G\u001b[39mrun\u001b[72Gcreated\u001b[80Ga\u001b[82Gsecond\u001b[89Gcopy\u001b[94Gof\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gwhole\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpage tree. This installation was filled\u001b[43Gb\u001b[46Gthe seed script, so it had n\u001b[75Gver recorded that the\u001b[97Gpackage's\r\u001b[2C\u0