[955.032282, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5GI\u001b[7Gread\u001b[12Gthe\u001b[16Gboreholes\u001b[26Gdate\u001b[31G\"2062\"\u001b[38Gas 2026.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- I left out \"Youth bursaries: applicat\u001b[43Gons \u001b[48Gpen\" be\u001b[56Gau\u001b[59Ge it breaks\u001b[71Goff mid-sentence.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSomething to know on this installation:\u001b[22m my first\u001b[52G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mextension:setup\u001b[68G\u001b[39mrun\u001b[72Gcreated\u001b[80Ga\u001b[82Gsecond\u001b[89Gcopy\u001b[94Gof\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gwhole\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpage tree. This installation was filled by the seed script, so it had never r\u001b[81Gcorded that\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gpackage's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcontent\u001b[11Gwas\u001b[15Gimported.\u001b[25GI\u001b[27Grestored\u001b[36Gthe\u001b[40Gdatabase\u001b[49Gfrom\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58Gsnapshot\u001b[67GI\u001b[69Gtook\u001b[74Gbeforehand\u001b[85Gand\u001b[89Grecorded\u001b[98Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bimport. Now the data is clean: 29 pages, one group. The README explains how to\u001b[82Gavoid this.\u001b[94G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhere things are:\u001b[22m the\u001b[25Gnews \u001b[31Gempla\u001b[37Ges\u001b[40Gare in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Extensions/News/\u001b[39m, routing in\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mroute-enhancers.yaml\u001b[39m, the group in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mClasses/Initialization/CreateEditorGroupOnPackageInitialization.php\u001b[39m,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band\u001b[7Gthe\u001b[11Gseed\u001b[16Gscript\u001b[23Gis\u001b[26G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mBuild/Initialisation/seed-news.php\u001b[39m.\u001b[62GThe\u001b[66Gupdated\u001b[74G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[83G\u001b[39mexport\u001b[90Gincludes\u001b[99Gall\u001b[103Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnews tables. Nothing is committed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNot done yet: the test on