[6650.238476, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat editors get\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\"News records\" fo\u001b[25Gder holding 8\u001b[40Gategories and 7 news\u001b[61Git\u001b[64Gms taken from\u001b[78Gthe doc\u001b[86Gment.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA backend\u001b[15Ggroup calle\u001b[27G \"Editors\", created\u001b[47Gautomatically\u001b[61Gwhen\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gpackage\u001b[78Gis\u001b[81Gset\u001b[85Gup.\u001b[89GI\u001b[91Gchecked\u001b[99Gwith\u001b[104Ga\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btemporary test user (del\u001b[30Gted afterwards). They can:\u001b[57G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bedit pages, content, news and categories\u001b[48Gon\u001b[51Gevery\u001b[57Gpage;\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Bse the P\u001b[19G, List and Media modules;\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bupload image\u001b[20G,\u001b[22Gw\u001b[24Gich go to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfileadmin/user_upload/news/\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- They can't use the raw HTML\u001b[35Gcon\u001b[39Gent\u001b[43Gelemen\u001b[50G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BPag\u001b[9Gs crea\u001b[16Ged\u001b[20Gater bel\u001b[29Gng to Editors autom\u001b[49Gt\u001b[51Gcal\u001b[55Gy.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BA text editor\u001b[19Glimit\u001b[25Gd to paragraphs, two heading levels, bol\u001b[66G, italic, lists\u001b[82Gand l\u001b[89Gks.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GYou\u001b[9Gonly\u001b[14Gneed\u001b[19Gto\u001b[22Gcreate\u001b[29Gthe\u001b[33Geditor\u001b[40Gaccounts\u001b[49G(System\u001b[57G>\u001b[59GBackend\u001b[67Gusers)\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Gput\u001b[82Gthem\u001b[87Gin\u001b[90G\"Editors\".\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mContent I changed on my own\u001b[22m (the Communications Offic\u001b[57G should check this)\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bfixed the typos from \u001b[29Ghe document: \"the\u001b[47Gthe\",\u001b[53G\"there\u001b[60Gstall\",\u001b[68G\"Pedestrains\",\u001b[83G\"helth\",\u001b[92G\"volunter\".\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Br\u001b[9Gad\u001b