[6650.550521, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gbrowser-tab title.\u001b[24GAn address that \u001b[41Goesn't \u001b[49Gxist gives\u001b[60Ga 404.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe breadcrumb now shows on N\u001b[35Gws and\u001b[42Gartic\u001b[48Ge\u001b[50Gpages. It was\u001b[64Galso missing b\u001b[79Gfore on\u001b[87Gthe other pages\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bhidden from the me\u001b[24Gu\u001b[26G(the E-services po\u001b[46Gal, for \u001b[55Gxample), becaus\u001b[71G the breadcrumb skipp\u001b[93Gd\u001b[95Gpages \u001b[102Gidden\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfrom\u001b[11Ghe navigation.\u001b[26GThat's\u001b[33Gfixed.\u001b[40GOn\u001b[43Garticle\u001b[51Gpages\u001b[57Git\u001b[60Gcurrently\u001b[70Gends\u001b[75Gin\u001b[78G\"Article\"\u001b[88Grather\u001b[95Gthan\u001b[100Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bnews\u001b[10Gtitle.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat editors get\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\"News records\" fo\u001b[25Gder holding 8\u001b[40Gategories and 7 news\u001b[61Git\u001b[64Gms taken from\u001b[78Gthe doc\u001b[86Gment.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA backend\u001b[15Ggroup calle\u001b[27G \"Editors\", created\u001b[47Gautomatically\u001b[61Gwhen\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gpackage\u001b[78Gis\u001b[81Gset\u001b[85Gup.\u001b[89GI\u001b[91Gchecked\u001b[99Gwith\u001b[104Ga\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btemporary test user (del\u001b[30Gted afterwards). They can:\u001b[57G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bedit pages, content, news and categories\u001b[48Gon\u001b[51Gevery\u001b[57Gpage;\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Bse the P\u001b[19G, List and Media modules;\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bupload image\u001b[20G,\u001b[22Gw\u001b[24Gich go to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfileadmin/user_upload/news/\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- They can't use the raw HTML\u001b[35Gcon\u001b[39Gent\u001b[43Gelemen\u001b[50G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BPag\u001b[9Gs crea\u001b[16Ged\u001b[20Gater bel\u001b[29Gng to Editors autom\u001b[49Gt\u001