[6650.61769, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat visitors see\u001b[21G\u001b[22m(checked\u001b[30Gon\u001b[33Gdemo.ddev.site)\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BThe home page shows the three newest news as cards,\u001b[57Gwith \"Al\u001b[66G news\" link\u001b[78Gng\u001b[81Gto\u001b[84G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/news\u001b[39m,\u001b[91Gmatching\u001b[100Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdesign.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/news\u001b[39m lists\u001b[17Gall seve\u001b[27Gnews items. Each one\u001b[48Gopens\u001b[54Gat a readable\u001b[68Gaddress\u001b[76Glike\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/news/article/new-fish-market-opens-at-the-jetty\u001b[39m. The article's\u001b[69Gt\u001b[71Gtle is the page\u001b[87Gheading and the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbrowser-tab\u001b[18Gitle. An addres\u001b[34G that doesn't exist\u001b[54Ggives a 404.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe breadcrumb now shows on\u001b[33GNews and article pages.\u001b[57GI\u001b[60Gwas also missing before on the other pages\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bhidden from\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gmenu\u001b[26G(the\u001b[31GE-services\u001b[42Gportal,\u001b[50Gfor\u001b[54Gexample),\u001b[64Gbecause\u001b[72Gthe\u001b[76Gbreadcrumb\u001b[87Gskipped\u001b[95Gpages\u001b[101Ghidden\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfrom\u001b[10Gthe\u001b[14Gnavigation.\u001b[26GThat's\u001b[33Gfixed.\u001b[40GOn\u001b[43Garticle\u001b[51Gpages\u001b[57Git\u001b[60Gcurrently\u001b[70Gends\u001b[75Gin\u001b[78G\"Article\"\u001b[88Grather\u001b[95Gthan\u001b[100Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  news title.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat editors get\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA \"News records\" folder hol\u001b[33Ging 8 c\u001b[41Gtegories and 7 news\u001b[61Gitems\u001b[67Gtaken\u001b[73Gfrom\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gdocument.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA\u001b[7Gbackend group called\u001b[28G\"Editors\", created automatically when\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gpackage\u001b[78Gis\u001b[81Gset\u001b[85Gup.\u001b[89GI\u001b[91Gchecked\u001b[99Gwith\u001b[104Ga\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btemporary\u001b[15Gtest user (delet\u001b[33G \u001b[35Gfterwards).\u001b[47GThey\u001b[52Gcan:\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bedit pages, content,\u001b[28Gnews and categories on every page;\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bus\u001b[10G the Page, List\u001b[26Gand\u001b[30GMedia modules;\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- upload images, which go to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfileadmin/user_upload/news/\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G-\u001b[7GThey\u001b[12Gcan't use th\u001b[25G raw\u001b[30GHTML content elem\u001b[48Gnt.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BPages creat\u001b[19Glate\u001b[24G belong to Editors a\u001b[45Gtomatically.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA\u001b[7Gtext\u001b[12Geditor\u001b[19Glimited\u001b[27Gto\u001b[30Gparagraphs,\u001b[42Gtwo\u001b[46Gheading\u001b[54Glevels,\u001b[62Gbold,\u001b[68Gitalic,\u001b[76Glists\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Glinks.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- You only need to create the edit\u001b[38Gr accounts (System > Backend users) and\u001b[78Gput\u001b[82Gthem\u001b[87Gin\u001b[90G\"Editors\".\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mContent I changed on my own\u001b[31G\u001b[22m(the Communications\u001b[51GOffice\u001b[58Gshould\u001b[65Gcheck\u001b[71Gthis)\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bfixed the typos\u001b[23Gfrom th\u001b[31G document\u001b[69GPedestrain\u001b[80G\", \"helth\",\u001b[92G\"volunter\".\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
