[6651.004964, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Allow\u001b[12Gd by auto mode\r\u001b[2B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNews\u001b[8Gis\u001b[11Gworking\u001b[19Gon\u001b[22Gthe\u001b[26Ghome\u001b[31Gpage,\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41GNews\u001b[46Gpage\u001b[51Gand\u001b[55Gon\u001b[58Garticle\u001b[66Gpages.\u001b[73GThe\u001b[77G\"Editors\"\u001b[87Ggroup\u001b[93Gis\u001b[96Gset\u001b[100Gup,\u001b[104Gbut\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnothing has been test\u001b[25Gd on\u001b[30Ga fr\u001b[35Gsh installation\u001b[51Gyet.\u001b[56GThat\u001b[61Gtest\u001b[66Gneeds\u001b[72Gyour\u001b[77GOK\u001b[80G(see\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gend).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat visitors see\u001b[21G\u001b[22m(checked\u001b[30Gon\u001b[33Gdemo.ddev.site)\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BThe home page shows the three newest news as cards,\u001b[57Gwith \"Al\u001b[66G news\" link\u001b[78Gng\u001b[81Gto\u001b[84G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/news\u001b[39m,\u001b[91Gmatching\u001b[100Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdesign.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/news\u001b[39m lists\u001b[17Gall seve\u001b[27Gnews items. Each one\u001b[48Gopens\u001b[54Gat a readable\u001b[68Gaddress\u001b[76Glike\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/news/article/new-fish-market-opens-at-the-jetty\u001b[39m. The article's\u001b[69Gt\u001b[71Gtle is the page\u001b[87Gheading and the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbrowser-tab\u001b[18Gitle. An addres\u001b[34G that doesn't exist\u001b[54Ggives a 404.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe breadcrumb now shows on\u001b[33GNews and article pages.\u001b[57GI\u001b[60Gwas also missing before on the other pages\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bhidden from\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gmenu\u001b[26G(the\u001b[31GE-services\u001b[42Gportal,\u001b[50Gfor\u001b[54Gexample),\