ws/article/new-fish-market-opens-at-the-jetty\u001b[39m.\u001b[55GThe\u001b[59Garticle's\u001b[69Gtitle\u001b[75Gis\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gpage\u001b[87Gheading\u001b[95Gand\u001b[99Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gbrowser-tab title. An address\u001b[35Gthat doesn't exist gives a 404.\u001b[67G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe breadcrumb\u001b[20Gnow\u001b[24Gshows\u001b[30Gon\u001b[33GNews\u001b[38Gand\u001b[42Garticle\u001b[50Gpages.\u001b[57GIt\u001b[60Gwas\u001b[64Galso\u001b[69Gmissing\u001b[77Gbefore\u001b[84Gon\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Gother\u001b[97Gpages\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Ghidden from\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gm\u001b[23Gnu (the E-s\u001b[35Grvices portal, for\u001b[54Gexampl\u001b[61G), \u001b[65Gecause the\u001b[76Gbreadcrumb\u001b[87Gskipped\u001b[95Gpages\u001b[101Ghidden\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfrom the navigation. That's fixed. On article pages it currently ends\u001b[76Gn\u001b[78G\"Articl\u001b[86G\" r\u001b[90Gther\u001b[95Gthan the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bnews title.\u001b[17G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat editors get\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA \"News records\" folder holding 8 categor\u001b[47Ges and 7 news items tak\u001b[72G from\u001b[78Gthe document.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA backend group\u001b[21Gcalled\u001b[28G\"Editors\",\u001b[39Gcreated\u001b[47Gautomatically\u001b[61Gwhen\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gpackage\u001b[78Gis\u001b[81Gset\u001b[85Gup.\u001b[89GI\u001b[91Gchecked\u001b[99Gwith\u001b[104Ga\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btemporary\u001b[15Gtest\u001b[20Guser\u001b[25G(deleted\u001b[34Gafterw\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
