ors\",\u001b[39Gcreated\u001b[47Gautomatically\u001b[61Gwhen\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gpackage\u001b[78Gis\u001b[81Gset\u001b[85Gup.\u001b[89GI\u001b[91Gchecked\u001b[99Gwith\u001b[104Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtemporary test user (delete\u001b[33G afterw\u001b[41Grds). They can:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G-\u001b[7Gedit pages, content,\u001b[28Gnews and categories on every page;\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- use the\u001b[15GPage, List and M\u001b[33Gi\u001b[35G modules;\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bupload images, which\u001b[28Ggo to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfileadmin/user_upload/news/\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BTh\u001b[10Gy can't use the\u001b[26Graw\u001b[30GHTML content element.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GPages created later belong to Editors automatically.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA\u001b[7Gtext\u001b[12Geditor limit\u001b[25Gd to\u001b[30Gparagraphs, two h\u001b[48Gading\u001b[54Glevels,\u001b[62Gbold,\u001b[68Gitalic,\u001b[76Glists\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Glinks.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BYou only ne\u001b[19Gto c\u001b[24Geate the editor acco\u001b[45Gnts (System >\u001b[59GBackend\u001b[67Gusers)\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Gput\u001b[82Gthem\u001b[87Gin\u001b[90G\"Editors\".\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mContent I changed on my own\u001b[22m (the C\u001b[38Gmmunications Office should check this)\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GI\u001b[7Gfixed\u001b[13Gthe\u001b[17Gtypos\u001b[23Gfrom\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32Gdocument\u001b[69GPedestrains\",\u001b[83G\"helth\",\u001b[92G\"volunter\".\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
