[6698.26998, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mContent I changed on my own\u001b[22m (the C\u001b[38Gmmunications Office should check this)\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GI\u001b[7Gfixed\u001b[13Gthe\u001b[17Gtypos\u001b[23Gfrom\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32Gdocument:\u001b[42G\"the\u001b[47Gthe\",\u001b[53G\"there\u001b[60Gstall\",\u001b[68G\"Pedestrains\",\u001b[83G\"helth\",\u001b[92G\"volunter\".\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- I read the boreholes date\u001b[31G\"2062\" as 2026.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bleft out \"Youth\u001b[23Gbursari\u001b[31Gs: applications\u001b[47Gop\u001b[50Gn\"\u001b[53Gbecause it breaks off mid-\u001b[80Gentence.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSomething to know on this installation:\u001b[22m my first \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mextension:setup\u001b[39m run created a s\u001b[84Gcond\u001b[89Gcopy\u001b[94Gof\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gwhole\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpage\u001b[8Gtree.\u001b[14GThis\u001b[19Ginstallation\u001b[32Gwas\u001b[36Gfilled\u001b[43Gby\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gseed\u001b[55Gscript,\u001b[63Gso\u001b[66Git\u001b[69Ghad\u001b[73Gnever\u001b[79Grecorded\u001b[88Gthat\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gpackage's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcontent was imported. I restored the database from the snapshot I took beforehand a\u001b[89Grecorded the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bimpor\u001b[9G. Now the\u001b[19Gdata is clean: 29 pag\u001b[41Gs, one group.\u001b[55GThe README\u001b[66Gexpl\u001b[71Gins how\u001b[79Gto avoi\u001b[90Gis.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhere things are:\u001b[22m \u001b[22Ghe news templates are\u001b[44Gi\u001b[46G \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Extensions/News/\u001b[39m, r\u001b[85Guting in\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mroute-enhancers.yaml\u001b[39m,\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Ggroup\u001b[35Gin\u001b[38G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mClasses/Initialization/CreateEditorGroupOnPackageInitialization.php\u001b[39m,\r\u00