[6698.290173, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSomething to know on this installation:\u001b[43G\u001b[22mmy\u001b[46Gfirst\u001b[52G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mextension:setup\u001b[68G\u001b[39mrun\u001b[72Gcreated\u001b[80Ga\u001b[82Gsecond\u001b[89Gcopy\u001b[94Gof\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gwhole\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpage tree. This installation was filled\u001b[43Gb\u001b[46Gthe seed script, so it had n\u001b[75Gver recorded that the\u001b[97Gpackage's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcontent was imported. I restored\u001b[36Gthe database from the snapsh\u001b[65Gt I\u001b[69Gtook beforehand and record\u001b[96Gd the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bimport.\u001b[11GNow\u001b[15Gthe data is\u001b[27Gclean: 29 pages, one group. The README explains how to avoid this.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhere things are:\u001b[21G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[25Gnews\u001b[30Gtemplates\u001b[40Gare\u001b[44Gin\u001b[47G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Extensions/News/\u001b[39m,\u001b[83Grouting\u001b[91Gin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mroute-enhancers.yaml\u001b[39m,\u001b[25Gthe grou\u001b[34G in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mClasses/Initialization/Cr\u001b[64GateEditorGroupOnPackageInitialization.php\u001b[39m,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band the seed script is \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mBuild/Initialisation/seed-news.php\u001b[39m. The updated \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[39m export includes all the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnews tabl\u001b[13Gs.\u001b[16GNothing is committed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNot done yet: the test on a fresh installation.\u001b[51G\u001b[22mIt's\u001b[56Gthe\u001b[60Gonly\u001b[65Gproof\u001b[71Gthat\u001b[76Gthe\u001b[80Gpackage\u001b[88Gworks\u001b[94Gon\u001b[97Gan\u001b[100Gempty\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Binstallation, and that test was blocked. The test needs the database dropped\u001b[80Gand \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3 setup\u001b[39m ru\u001b[100Gfr