[6698.302849, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  page tree. This installation was filled by the seed script, so it had never recorded that the package's\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcontent\u001b[11Gwas\u001b[15Gimported.\u001b[25GI\u001b[27Grestored\u001b[36Gthe\u001b[40Gdatabase\u001b[49Gfrom\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58Gsnapshot\u001b[67GI\u001b[69Gtook\u001b[74Gbeforehand\u001b[85Gand\u001b[89Grecorded\u001b[98Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bimport. Now the data is clean: 29 pages, one group. The README explains how to\u001b[82Gavoid this.\u001b[94G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhere things are:\u001b[22m the\u001b[25Gnews \u001b[31Gempla\u001b[37Ges\u001b[40Gare in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Extensions/News/\u001b[39m, routing in\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mroute-enhancers.yaml\u001b[39m, the group in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mClasses/Initialization/CreateEditorGroupOnPackageInitialization.php\u001b[39m,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band\u001b[7Gthe\u001b[11Gseed\u001b[16Gscript\u001b[23Gis\u001b[26G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mBuild/Initialisation/seed-news.php\u001b[39m.\u001b[62GThe\u001b[66Gupdated\u001b[74G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[83G\u001b[39mexport\u001b[90Gincludes\u001b[99Gall\u001b[103Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnews tables. Nothing is committed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNot done yet: the test on a fresh installation.\u001b[22m It's the only proof that the package works on an emp\u001b[104Gy\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Binstallation, and that test was blocked.\u001b[44GThe\u001b[48Gtest\u001b[53Gneeds\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gdatabase\u001b[72Gdropped\u001b[80Gand\u001b[84G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3 setup\u001b[96G\u001b[39mrun\u001b[100Gfrom\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bscratch.\u001b[12GI've\u001b[17Galready\u001b[25Gsaved\u001b[31Ga\u001b[33Gdatabase\u001b[42Gsnapshot\u001b[51G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mafter-news\u001b[39m)\u001b[64Gand\u001b[68Gcopies\u001b[75Gof\u001b[78G\u001b[38;