[6721.674735, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- A \"News records\"\u001b[22Gfolder\u001b[29Gholding\u001b[37G8\u001b[39Gcategories\u001b[50Gand\u001b[54G7\u001b[56Gnews\u001b[61Gitems\u001b[67Gtaken\u001b[73Gfrom\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gdocument.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bbackend group cal\u001b[25Ged \"Editors\",\u001b[40Greated automatically\u001b[61Gwh\u001b[64Gn the package\u001b[78Gis set \u001b[86Gp. I checked\u001b[99Gwith\u001b[104Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtemporary\u001b[15Gtest user (\u001b[27Geleted afterwards).\u001b[47GThey can:\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- edit pages, content, n\u001b[30Gws and categories on every\u001b[57Gpage;\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Buse the Page, List and Media modules;\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Bpload im\u001b[19Gs, which go to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfileadmin/user_upload/news/\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BThey can't u\u001b[20Ge\u001b[22Gt\u001b[24Ge raw HTML content element.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GPages created later belong to\u001b[35GEdi\u001b[39Gors\u001b[43Gautoma\u001b[50Gically.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BA t\u001b[9Gxt edi\u001b[16Gor\u001b[20Gimited t\u001b[29G paragraphs, two he\u001b[49Gd\u001b[51Gng \u001b[55Gevels,\u001b[62Gbold,\u001b[68Gitalic,\u001b[76Glists\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Glinks.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BYou only need\u001b[19Gto cr\u001b[25Gate the editor accounts (System > Backen\u001b[66G users) and put\u001b[82Gthem \u001b[89G \"Editors\".\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mContent I changed on my own\u001b[31G\u001b[22m(the\u001b[36GCommunications\u001b[51GOffice\u001b[58Gshould\u001b[65Gcheck\u001b[71Gthis)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- I fixed the typos from the document: \"the the\", \"th\u001b[57Gre stall\", \"Pedestrains\",\u001b[83G\"helth\",\u001b[92G\"volunter\".\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bread the boreholes da\u001b[29Ge \"2062\" as 2026.\u001b[47G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bl\u001b[9Gft\u001b[12Gout\u001b[16G\"Youth burs\u001b[28Gries: applications\u001b[47Gopen\"\u001b[53Gbecause\u