[6735.602629, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSomething to know on this installation:\u001b[22m my first \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mextension:setup\u001b[39m run created a s\u001b[84Gcond\u001b[89Gcopy\u001b[94Gof\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gwhole\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpage\u001b[8Gtree.\u001b[14GThis\u001b[19Ginstallation\u001b[32Gwas\u001b[36Gfilled\u001b[43Gby\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gseed\u001b[55Gscript,\u001b[63Gso\u001b[66Git\u001b[69Ghad\u001b[73Gnever\u001b[79Grecorded\u001b[88Gthat\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gpackage's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcontent was imported. I restored the database from the snapshot I took beforehand a\u001b[89Grecorded the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bimpor\u001b[9G. Now the\u001b[19Gdata is clean: 29 pag\u001b[41Gs, one group.\u001b[55GThe README\u001b[66Gexpl\u001b[71Gins how\u001b[79Gto avoi\u001b[90Gis.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhere things are:\u001b[22m \u001b[22Ghe news templates are\u001b[44Gi\u001b[46G \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Extensions/News/\u001b[39m, r\u001b[85Guting in\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mroute-enhancers.yaml\u001b[39m,\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Ggroup\u001b[35Gin\u001b[38G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mClasses/Initialization/CreateEditorGroupOnPackageInitialization.php\u001b[39m,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band the seed scrip\u001b[22G is \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mBuild/Initialisation/s\u001b[49Ged-new\u001b[56G.php\u001b[39m. The updated \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[83G\u001b[39mexport includes\u001b[99Gall\u001b[103Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnews tables. Nothing is committed.\u001b[38G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNot done yet: the test on a fresh installation.\u001b[51G\u001b[22mIt's\u001b[56Gthe\u001b[60Gonly\u001b[65Gproof\u001b[71Gthat\u001b[76Gthe\u001b[80Gpackage\u001b[88Gworks\u001b[94Gon\u001b[97Gan\u001b[100Gempty\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Binstallation,\u001b[17Gand\u001b[21Gthat\u001b[26Gtest\u001b[31Gwas\u001b[35Gblocked